<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第二幕 · HARNESS 里头</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>每一次真实动作，都要经过 harness</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 380, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", alignItems: "center", gap: 10}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>上层</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.55)"}}>Loop / Graph</Text><Box style={{width: 2, height: 40, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.22)"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56"}}>运行边界</Text><Box style={{width: 2, height: 40, background: "#0F6E56"}}></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>真实动作</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 748, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>01</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>每个可执行节点，最终都落到一次真实执行</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}>上层不会自动修复底层的缺口。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>02</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Loop 每次迭代实例化一个 harness</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}></Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 20, alignItems: "flex-start", borderLeft: "3px solid rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", paddingLeft: 22}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", marginTop: 8}}>03</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Graph 的每个节点跑在自己的 harness 里</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10}}></Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>14 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
